<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Sherill Kay | Golden Retriever Breeder</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head><body><header><div class="top">Sherill Kay · Golden Retriever Breeder <span>Text: +1 (872) 216-2415</span></div><nav><a class="brand" href="/">SHERILL KAY<small>GOLDEN RETRIEVER BREEDER</small></a><div class="links"><a href="#puppies">Available Puppies</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#process">Our Process</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a><a class="admin" href="/admin/login">Admin Login</a></div></nav></header><section class="hero" style="background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.78),rgba(0,0,0,.2)),url('<%= images.hero || 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552053831-71594a27632d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=80' %>')"><div><p class="eyebrow">RAISED WITH CARE</p><h1>Beautiful Golden Retrievers,<br><em>Family Ready.</em></h1><p>We are committed to raising healthy, well-socialized Golden Retriever puppies in a caring environment. Each puppy receives attentive care and early socialization to help them grow into confident companions.</p><a class="button" href="#puppies">View Available Puppies</a></div></section><section id="puppies" class="section"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">CURRENT LITTERS</p><h2>Available Golden Retriever Puppies</h2><p>View each puppy's information and contact Sherill Kay by text or email.</p></div><div class="grid"><% puppies.forEach(p=>{ %><article class="card"><% if(p.image){ %><img src="<%= p.image.startsWith('http')?p.image:'/uploads/'+p.image %>" alt="<%= p.name %>"><% }else{ %><div class="placeholder">Puppy photo</div><% } %><div class="cardbody"><span class="badge"><%= p.status %></span><h3><%= p.name %></h3><p><%= p.gender %> · <%= p.age %></p><strong><%= p.price %></strong><a href="/puppy/<%= p.id %>" class="textlink">View puppy →</a></div></article><% }) %></div></section><section id="about" class="split"><div class="photo" style="background-image:url('<%= images.about || 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605568427561-40dd23c2acea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80' %>')"></div><div><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT SHERILL KAY</p><h2>A thoughtful start for every puppy.</h2><p>Use this section to describe the breeder's real experience, puppy-raising practices, socialization, veterinary care, and what families can expect.</p><div class="checks"><span>✓ Health records</span><span>✓ Age-appropriate care</span><span>✓ Family-focused placement</span><span>✓ Ongoing communication</span></div></div></section><section id="process" class="section light"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">ADOPTION PROCESS</p><h2>Simple, transparent, personal.</h2></div><div class="steps"><% processSteps.forEach(s=>{ %><div><b><%= s.step_number %></b><h3><%= s.title %></h3><p><%= s.description %></p></div><% }) %></div></section><section id="contact" class="contact"><div><p class="eyebrow">GET IN TOUCH</p><h2>Interested in a puppy?</h2><p>Send Sherill Kay a text message or email about the available Golden Retriever puppies.</p><div class="contact-buttons"><a class="button" href="sms:+18722162415?body=Hi%20Sherill%20Kay%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20one%20of%20your%20Golden%20Retriever%20puppies.%20Could%20you%20tell%20me%20more%3F">Text Sherill Kay</a><a class="button secondary" href="mailto:angelacartex@gmail.com?subject=Golden%20Retriever%20puppy%20inquiry&body=Hi%20Sherill%20Kay%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20one%20of%20your%20Golden%20Retriever%20puppies.%20Could%20you%20tell%20me%20more%3F">Email Sherill Kay</a></div></div></section><footer>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Sherill Kay · Golden Retriever Breeder <a href="/admin/login">Admin</a></footer></body></html>
